naging this condition involves regular health assessments and a comprehensive lifestyle approach." resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.szalongevity.sza_mobile" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[195,464][960,484]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="SRP54 Gene: This gene is linked to severe congenital neutropenia type 8, affecting the body's ability to produce certain white blood cells. Lifestyle modifications and regular assessments can play a significant role in managing this condition." resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.szalongevity.sza_mobile" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[195,510][960,965]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="SMAD3 Gene: Related to Aneurysm-Osteoarthritis syndrome, a hereditary condition involving aneurysms and osteoarthritis. Effective management includes regular medical check-ups and a tailored exercise routine." resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.szalongevity.sza_mobile" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[195,991][960,1446]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="Remember, these genetic findings offer insights into predispositions, but they’re not definitive predictors of your health outcomes. It’s important to discuss any concerns with a healthcare provider to explore personalized prevention and management strategies. If you'd like more information on other genes or conditions, let me know!" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.szalongevit